{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"192751","name":"The Caesar Hotel Roma","description":"تم ترميم هذا الفندق بالكامل في عام 2013. بإمكان المسافرين الاستفادة من الاتصال بالإنترنت في الأماكن العامة في The Caesar Hotel Roma. بإمكان العملاء الاستمتاع بالرفاهية التي يضمنها توفر مكتب الاستقبال على مدار الساعة. يقدم The Caesar Hotel Roma موقفاً للسيارات لضمان رفاهية النزلاء. يمتاز The Caesar Hotel Roma بمجموعة متنوعة من مرافق الأعمال من أجل تقديم التوليفة المثالية من الراحة والرفاهية لرحلات موظفي الشركات. قد يفرض The Caesar Hotel Roma رسماً على بعض الخدمات.","address":"Via della Pisana, 374, 374","city":"ROME","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00163","lat":41.86871379999999,"lng":12.4115129,"stars":4,"chain":"GITAV","giataCode":"49788","phone":"+3906835521","email":"info@thecaesarroma.com","website":"https://thecaesarhotels.com/the-caesar-roma/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_a_003_20250730_144542.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_l_014_20250730_144332.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_l_010.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_l_015_20250730_144443.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_l_016_20250730_144444.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_l_017_20250730_144445.jpg","category":"lobby","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/19/192751/192751a_hb_l_018_20251228_201735.jpg","category":"lobby","order":8},{"url":"https://pho